      "url": "https://orangecoastcollege.edu/about/institutional-effectiveness/docs/finalizedocc-research-process-and-guidelines-20241.pdf",
      "summary": "The document outlines the policies and procedures for research at Orange Coast College, focusing on the role of the Research Review Subcommittee in protecting research participants and ensuring compliance with state and federal regulations. It clarifies when formal review is required for both internal and external research proposals, and the principles derived from the Belmont Report that guide the review process. While the college does not maintain a federally approved IRB, it implements similar guidelines to ensure ethical research practices on campus.",
